   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "6  queue it on that service's FIFO queue\n7  pick an instance: Service Discovery's list,\n     least loaded, circuit breaker closed\n8  deliver (one worker thread per delivery)\n     network error, timeout or safe 5xx \u2192\n     retry on another instance (max 3 tries)\n9  nothing works \u2192 dead letter, and an\n     error answer goes back to the Gateway",
   "originalText": "6  queue it on that service's FIFO queue\n7  pick an instance: Service Discovery's list,\n     least loaded, circuit breaker closed\n8  deliver (one worker thread per delivery)\n     network error, timeout or safe 5xx \u2192\n     retry on another instance (max 3 tries)\n9  nothing works \u2192 dead letter, and an\n     error answer goes back to the Gateway",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
