   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "\u2022 Player and Resource Service call nobody; Base Service is called by nobody.\n\u2022 A caller sends to the broker: REST on :8090 with X-Broker-Service, or gRPC on :9090.\n\u2022 The broker delivers gRPC to the instance's grpc_url (:50051) that Service Discovery lists.\n\u2022 Contracts: proto/<service>/v1/*.proto. REST stays as the fallback when BROKER_GRPC_URL is empty.",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Player and Resource Service call nobody; Base Service is called by nobody.\n\u2022 A caller sends to the broker: REST on :8090 with X-Broker-Service, or gRPC on :9090.\n\u2022 The broker delivers gRPC to the instance's grpc_url (:50051) that Service Discovery lists.\n\u2022 Contracts: proto/<service>/v1/*.proto. REST stays as the fallback when BROKER_GRPC_URL is empty.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
